# Python / Quickshell
**/__pycache__/
**/.venv/
**/*.pyc

# Cache e logs em qualquer pasta rastreada
**/cache/
**/Cache/
**/*.log
**/*.bak
**/*.old
**/*.tmp
**/*.swp
**/*~